hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"83","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah pehre dene wale pehredaron par rehem farmaye — Aap ne ye teen martaba farmaya — jo [foj] Room aur musalmanon ke lashkar ke darmiyan hote hain; wo un [musalmanon] ke liye [dushman par] nazar rakhte hain aur unhen khabardar karte hain.'"
